    "type": "page_break",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "[POLICY] Story 2: Anthropic ID Verification Goes Live -- Claude Now Requires Government ID",
    "level": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "THE STORY: July 8 marks the effective date of Anthropic's controversial privacy policy update. Consumer Claude users (Free, Pro, Max) can now be required to upload government-issued photo ID, submit a live selfie, and undergo facial geometry scanning via Persona Identities before accessing certain features. This is the first time a major US frontier AI lab has mandated biometric identity verification for consumer accounts."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "Key Details",
    "level": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "- Verification partner: Persona Identities -- same vendor whose CEO has argued with users on Twitter"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "- What they collect: Government ID photo, live selfie, facial geometry scan"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "- What they DON'T accept: Photocopies, screenshots, digital IDs, student IDs, library cards"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "- Who's affected: Consumer accounts only (Free/Pro/Max). Team/Enterprise/API excluded"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "- Anthropic's stance: \"Verification data stays between you, Persona, and Anthropic\""
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "- Context: This is part of the Fable 5 export control redeployment agreement"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "Source Credibility: HIGH",
    "level": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Primary: Anthropic's own privacy policy & Claude Help Center. Confirmed by Cybernews, The Next Web, TechTimes, State of Surveillance, Medianama."
