  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "Wolffish Review",
    "level": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "I'm going to be real: this is a terrible user experience wrapped in a defensible security rationale. Yes, frontier models are powerful and yes, bad actors exist. But requiring a government ID and a biometric face scan to use a chatbot? That's the kind of friction that pushes people to alternatives."
