  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "The timing is especially rough -- this goes live the same week that Chinese models are eating 30-46% of US enterprise tokens and OpenAI is dropping GPT-5.6 globally. Anthropic just made their product harder to access while their competitors are making theirs easier. The Fable 5 credits switch (Story 3) compounds this -- now you pay MORE for a product that demands MORE from you."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Score: 3/10 -- A necessary evil in the age of frontier AI regulation, but the execution and timing are brutal. Privacy-conscious users will flee."
