  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "One under-discussed angle: the attacker specifically targeted AI-related credentials (OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek API keys). This wasn't just about ransom -- it was about stealing access to other AI systems. We're entering the era of AI-on-AI crime."
