  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "The geopolitical angle is fascinating too. The US government is asking labs to slow down releases for safety review, while US companies are routing their AI workloads to models from a country the government considers a strategic competitor. You can't regulate your way out of a price war -- especially when the cheaper option is open-weight and MIT-licensed."
