  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "- CarPlay support: Included in the rollout"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "- Intelligence control: Users can set how \"smart\" the voice model behaves"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "Source Credibility: HIGH",
    "level": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Primary: OpenAI official blog post & @OpenAI tweet with demo video. Confirmed by VentureBeat, TechCrunch, MacRumors, Thurrott, 9to5Mac, SQ Magazine."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
