  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Story 5: Chinese AI Models Hit 30-46% US Token Share"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Why: Every other story today -- OpenAI's release, Anthropic's pricing, government regulation, JADEPUFFER's automation -- is downstream of the fundamental economic reality that frontier AI is being commoditized faster than anyone predicted. When Coinbase cuts AI costs by 50% with Chinese models, that's not a trend. That's a market signal."
